<title>UK: F&amp;C Investment confident despite stg hit.</title>
<headline>F&amp;C Investment confident despite stg hit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British investment group Foreign &amp; Colonial Investment Trust Plc said on Thursday it was confident for the future despite major underperformance in 1996 because it failed to hedge against sterling's strength.</p>
</text>
